flowchart TD
    A[Start: User opens App] --> B[Dashboard]
    B --> C[Click 'Create Invoice']
    C --> D{Select Customer}
    D -->|Existing| E[Search/Select Customer]
    D -->|New| F[Add New Customer]
    E --> G[Add Items]
    F --> G
    G --> H[System calculates GST/Total]
    H --> I[Review Invoice]
    I --> J{Action}
    J -->|Save Draft| K[Saved to Drafts]
    J -->|Finalize| L[Generate Invoice PDF]
    L --> M[Share Options]
    M --> N[WhatsApp/Email/SMS]
    N --> O[Customer receives invoice]
    O --> P[Invoice marked as 'Sent']